# Excluded from the packed .mcpb / .dxt bundle.
#
# This is a DXT 0.1 python extension. Claude Desktop ships a Node.js runtime
# but no Python one, so the bundle vendors its dependencies into lib/ (see the
# release workflow) and launches them through mcpb_entry.py. lib/ must
# therefore NOT be excluded here.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.venv/
.venv-linux/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
# NOT *.py[cod] - that glob also matches *.pyd, the Windows native extension
# suffix, which silently strips every compiled wheel out of lib/ and leaves a
# bundle that dies on import. Same reason .so/.dylib are never excluded.
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
dist/
build/
tests/
scope.md
design.md
MVP.md
uv.lock
*.mcpb
*.dxt
.env
.DS_Store
